      versions below are the closest releases that work with the Maven in use; the packaging they
      produce is the same. The original values are recorded here so the change is visible:
        war.plugin.version = 2.6
        ear.plugin.version = 2.8
      Revert both if this reactor is ever built with a Maven 3.2-era toolchain again.
    -->
